elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">xAI推出Grok Build模式，支持通过自然语言直接生成网站与应用</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与Anthropic等1134名员工联名呼吁政府管控AI发展节奏</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布MCP协议第5版规范：彻底转向无状态架构并全面适配Serverless</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果系统更新首次在CVE漏洞归因中点名感谢Claude与Codex等AI模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ab0a74465a917d7a3767fccffcbaac4e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果在最新发布的iOS、iPadOS、watchOS、tvOS、visionOS及macOS Tahoe系统更新中，首次在官方CVE漏洞归因列表中明确提及AI模型贡献。此次修复的大量安全漏洞中，Anthropic的Claude模型与OpenAI的Codex Security各协助发现3项漏洞，NVIDIA AI红队贡献2项，Z.ai的GLM模型协助修复1项。研究人员Milad Nasr与Nicholas Carlini利用Claude模型成功修复了WebKit、WebKit Storage及WebDAV等关键模块漏洞。此次行动得益于Anthropic今年4月发起的1亿美元“Glasswing计划”，该计划联合苹果、微软、Google、亚马逊AWS及NVIDIA，通过专用Claude Mythos Preview</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面完成35亿美元F轮融资，投后估值达350亿美元并提前启动G轮</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">月之暗面旗下Kimi已正式完成F轮融资，融资金额超过35亿美元，投后估值升至350亿美元。由于市场认购规模达到原定目标的3倍以上，该轮融资已提前关闭。与此同时，月之暗面已提前启动原定于8月开启的G轮（Pre-IPO轮）融资，投前估值已抬升至500亿美元。此次融资节奏的快速推进，反映了资本市场对Kimi在LLM领域技术布局及商业化前景的高度认可。从F轮落定到G轮火速接棒，月之暗面在一级市场的融资节奏正以月为单位加速，显示出头部AI初创企业在资本获取能力上的极高溢价与市场热度。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">xAI推出Grok Build模式，支持通过自然语言直接生成网站与应用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b2713b9bed5394a327bf18f3bba64c64.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">xAI正式上线Grok Build模式，该功能允许用户通过自然语言提示词直接生成网站、功能性应用、游戏及实时仪表盘，无需编写代码即可实现产品从构思到实时预览与构建。目前该模式处于早期测试阶段，仅面向每月300美元的SuperGrok Heavy订阅用户开放。生成的产物支持通过grok.me链接发布，或绑定用户自定义域名。此次更新标志着Grok从对话助手向端到端开发平台转型，用户可在同一界面内完成产品构建。此举使xAI正式切入AI编程工具赛道，与现有开发类AI产品形成直接竞争，将AI的应用边界从信息交互进一步拓展至生产构建领域。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与Anthropic等1134名员工联名呼吁政府管控AI发展节奏</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dfaf2f00690c5d8d207e48031165c659.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">来自OpenAI、Anthropic、谷歌和Meta等公司的1134名员工近日签署名为“把控前沿”（Pacing the Frontier）的公开信，呼吁美国政府支持国际合作，建立治理工具以在必要时调控AI发展节奏。签署者包括OpenAI首席科学家雅库布·帕霍茨基、Anthropic CEO达里奥·阿莫代伊及Meta首席科学家赵晟佳等行业核心人物。此次倡议的核心关切是“递归式自我改进”，即AI系统具备自行开发和改进自身的能力。签署者担忧AI能力的发展速度可能迅速超出人类的理解与控制范畴。OpenAI CEO萨姆·奥尔特曼罕见表态支持，认为世界在未来需把控AI进步速度，以留出时间建立防护机制并让社会适应。Anthropic则强调其Claude系列模型研究显示，必须具备调控前沿发展速度的工具。此次联名标志着AI行业</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布MCP协议第5版规范：彻底转向无状态架构并全面适配Serverless</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0efd217a0fe9d17ba241bad4dc394cde.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于7月28日发布模型上下文协议（MCP）第5版规范，这是该协议自2024年11月推出以来规模最大、最系统性的颠覆式修订。新版核心变化在于彻底转向“无状态”设计，移除了旧版要求的握手环节与会话ID，使每个请求实现独立、自包含，从而完美适配AWS Lambda、Cloudflare Workers等Serverless架构，解决了水平扩展的限制。此外，新规范引入了版本化扩展框架，正式纳入MCP Apps与Tasks扩展，支持开发者在不改动核心协议的情况下增加交互界面与长时任务能力。在企业级授权方面，新版强化了对OAuth 2.0与OIDC的适配，支持直接连接Entra、Okta等身份系统。此次架构从会话绑定向请求自治的升级，旨在扫清AI智能体在生产环境中大规模部署的最后一道架构障碍。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
